@startuml domain-model
' PO 2026-09-12: the big association arrows read more naturally curved (default splines);
' the straight-edge rule applies to the C4 and flow diagrams, not to this class diagram.

' A42-15 — palette reused from the merged A42-11 theme (doc/plantuml/c4-styling.puml.inc,
' invoice-state-machine.puml): same hex values, same font-color pairings, so this diagram
' reads as part of the same document rather than inventing a new scheme.
' Grouping is by aggregate role, not by package:
'   core       #1A73E8 / white   — the Invoice aggregate itself (Invoice, InvoiceItem)
'   masterdata #3C88EB / #202124 — small aggregates referenced by an invoice (Recipient,
'                                  SenderProfile, Article), each owning its own child rows
'   reference  #81B2F2 / #202124 — standalone reference/lookup data (TaxRate, NumberRange)
'   receipt    #1662C5 / white   — object-storage-backed, not owned by any invoice
'   job        #9AA0A6 / #202124 — its own aggregate; bridges to kotlin-xpdf over NATS
' Contrast: identical bg/font pairs already carry their AA check in c4-styling.puml.inc /
' invoice-state-machine.puml — reused as-is, not recomputed.

skinparam defaultFontName "Roboto Condensed, Arial Narrow, sans-serif-condensed, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam class {
  FontSize 12
  ArrowColor #5F6368
  ArrowFontColor #202124
  ArrowFontSize 11
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #DADCE0
}

skinparam class<<core>> {
  BackgroundColor #1A73E8
  BorderColor #1456AE
  FontColor #ffffff
}

skinparam class<<masterdata>> {
  BackgroundColor #3C88EB
  BorderColor #2D66B0
  FontColor #202124
}

skinparam class<<reference>> {
  BackgroundColor #81B2F2
  BorderColor #5A7DA9
  FontColor #202124
}

skinparam class<<receipt>> {
  BackgroundColor #1662C5
  BorderColor #1456AE
  FontColor #ffffff
}

skinparam class<<job>> {
  BackgroundColor #9AA0A6
  BorderColor #74787C
  FontColor #202124
}

class Invoice <<core>> {
  id : Long
  invoiceNumber : InvoiceNumber
  status : InvoiceStatus
  typeCode : InvoiceTypeCode
  currency : Currency
  invoiceDate : LocalDate
  dueDate : LocalDate
  totals : InvoiceTotals
  reverseCharge : Boolean
}

' ADR-025 — status has a private setter (transitionTo/withInitialStatus are the only ways to
' set it); the items/documents/partySnapshots associations below are typed List, not
' MutableList, so addItem/removeItem/applyPartySnapshots remain the only mutation path. Not
' shown as UML visibility markers here (this diagram omits methods on purpose, see caption) —
' recorded as a note instead so the encapsulation is visible without reading the source.
note right of Invoice
  status: private set
  items/documents/partySnapshots:
  read-only List views
  (ADR-025)
end note

class InvoiceItem <<core>> {
  id : Long
  positionId : String
  category : InvoiceItemCategory
  quantity : BigDecimal
  unitPriceNet : Money
  taxRateSnapshot : BigDecimal
  netAmount : Money
  vatAmount : Money
  grossAmount : Money
}

class TripExpense <<core>> {
  id : Long
  kind : TripExpenseKind
  quantity : BigDecimal
  unitPriceNet : Money
  netAmount : Money
}

class TravelExpenseEntry <<core>> {
  id : Long
  travelDate : LocalDate
  country : Country
  calculatedAmount : Money
}

class Recipient <<masterdata>> {
  id : Long
  customerNumber : String
  name : String
  vatId : String
  customerType : CustomerType
}

class SenderProfile <<masterdata>> {
  id : Long
  name : String
  invoicePrefix : String
  vatId : String
  iban : Iban
  isDefault : Boolean
}

class Article <<masterdata>> {
  id : Long
  name : String
  category : InvoiceItemCategory
  defaultUnitPriceNet : Money
  isDefault : Boolean
}

class TaxRate <<reference>> {
  id : Long
  code : String
  rate : BigDecimal
  category : String
  country : Country
  validFrom : LocalDate
  validTo : LocalDate
}

class NumberRange <<reference>> {
  id : Long
  code : String
  subject : NumberRangeSubject
  continuity : Continuity
  startValue : Long
}

class Receipt <<receipt>> {
  id : Long
  fileName : String
  objectKey : String
  sha256Checksum : String
}

class GenerationJob <<job>> {
  id : Long
  jobType : String
  status : GenerationJobStatus
  engine : DocumentEngine
  attempts : Int
}

Invoice "1" *-- "0..*" InvoiceItem : items
Invoice "0..*" --> "0..1" SenderProfile : senderProfile
Invoice "0..*" --> "0..1" Recipient : recipient
InvoiceItem "0..*" -down-> "0..1" TaxRate : taxRateRef
InvoiceItem "0..*" --> "0..1" Article : articleRef
Article "0..*" --> "0..1" TaxRate : defaultTaxRateRef
Invoice "0..*" -- "0..*" Receipt : receipts
InvoiceItem "0..*" -right- "0..*" Receipt : receipts
GenerationJob "0..*" --> "1" Invoice : invoice
InvoiceItem "1" *-- "0..*" TripExpense : tripExpenses
InvoiceItem "1" *-- "0..*" TravelExpenseEntry : perDiemEntries

note right of NumberRange
  Allocates numbers for Invoice, Recipient,
  Article, SenderProfile — via services, no FK
end note

legend bottom left
Each box is one JPA entity class of the Quarkus application; attribute types are Kotlin types.
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<back:#1A73E8><color:#FFFFFF> Invoice aggregate      </color></back>| Invoice, InvoiceItem, TripExpense, TravelExpenseEntry — one repository, cascaded together |
|<back:#3C88EB><color:#202124> Master-data aggregate  </color></back>| Recipient, SenderProfile, Article — each owns its own child rows |
|<back:#81B2F2><color:#202124> Reference data         </color></back>| TaxRate, NumberRange — standalone, referenced by FK only |
|<back:#1662C5><color:#FFFFFF> Object-storage-backed  </color></back>| Receipt — linked, never owned, by any invoice/item |
|<back:#9AA0A6><color:#202124> Async job aggregate    </color></back>| GenerationJob — own repository, bridges to kotlin-xpdf |
endlegend

@enduml
